cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this data, please cite it as below."
title: "Fair and cheap: eight task designs for frontier evaluation in quantitative finance (MRF-2026-04 reproducibility data)"
abstract: >-
  Aggregate records for the one probed cell, the consolidated
  gate-0 dataset every value in the manuscript is drawn from with
  its source and method, and a self-contained script that
  recomputes both,
  behind Montana Research Foundation preprint MRF-2026-04. Task families, screening
  spike code, raw agent transcripts, and held-out grading data
  are withheld under
  contamination control (WITHHELD.md).
type: dataset
